  "summary": "This experiment tested a single-modality RNA-only model using pca_n2000 encoding, achieving validation accuracy of 0.4849 and F1 of 0.4639. These results suggest lower performance compared to the multimodal baseline (llm_summary_001), but direct comparison to other single-modality baselines is missing. The relative value of multimodal approaches versus single-modality encoders remains uncertain without additional comparative experiments."
